      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMAGINE THE FUN (1) missed the frame but clocked a strong 22.83 when fourth over 400m at this track last start in a OPEN. Should be in this for a long way. DIOGO KEEPING (8) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts 17 wins. Scored by 1.75 lengths last time (21.96) in a Grade 3/4/5 over 395m at Murray Bridge. Can hit the frame with the right run. DAKOTA RYLEN (7) crossed over from out wide but caught the leaders turning before drawing clear to score (22.67) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Goes very well from this draw with eight wins and four minor placings from 17 starts. One of the prime contenders. PARABOLE RICO (4) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance – sure to have admirers.",
